@subsection(Ablation study for the modification to reduce \ours training cost)

Table \ref{tab:training_cost} presents the GPU cost and the average accuracy of \ours with and without the proposed modification for commonsense reasoning tasks and image-text understanding tasks. The results indicate that the modification leads to a training memory reduction of approximately 24.4% in fine-tuning LLaMA and 12.4% in VL-BART. Furthermore, the accuracy of \ours with the modification remains unchanged for VL-BART and shows a negligible difference of only 0.2 compared to \ours without the modification on LLaMA.

